  "limitations": [
    "Associations within one recording, not causes: a teacher behaviour that precedes a student change may share a cause with it (the lesson plan, the topic, a script).",
    "Cameras are lined up by whole-second recording tags: about +/-1 s, hence 5 s windows.",
    "Student values are class averages of the known student time; unknown time is excluded, not zero.",
    "Teacher features present in fewer than min_active_windows windows are not tested by correlation; their onsets get peri-event averages when there are enough of them.",
    "Short or scripted lessons have little variation and few windows; findings need full lectures or several lessons before they say anything about teaching."
  ]
